# Helm Charts

This repository hosts Helm charts for various applications.

## Usage

Add this repository to your Helm client:

```bash
helm repo add dev-charts {{ .Env.REPO_URL }}
helm repo update
```

## Available Charts

| Chart | Description | Chart Version | App Version |
|---|---|---|---|
{{ range (datasource "charts").charts -}}
| **{{ .name }}** | {{ .description }} | ![Chart](https://img.shields.io/badge/Chart-{{ .version }}-informational?style=flat-square) | ![App](https://img.shields.io/badge/App-{{ .appVersion }}-informational?style=flat-square) |
{{ end }}
## Installation

```bash
{{ range (datasource "charts").charts -}}
# Install {{ .name }}
helm install {{ .name }}-release dev-charts/{{ .name }} -f your-values.yaml

{{ end -}}
```
